{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-43481","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50131","text":"--- name: deliberate description: Use when retrieve returns routing \"deliberate\", when κ > 0 is detected, before high-stakes decisions with cyclic knowledge, or when the user asks to \"deliberate\", \"reason through cycles\", \"analyze topology\", \"think through this carefully\". For detecting contradictions use "},{"id":"spn-50132","marks":["code"],"text":"belief"},{"id":"spn-50133","text":"; this skill reasons through cyclic structures once detected. Routes through the "},{"id":"spn-50134","marks":["code"],"text":"route"},{"id":"spn-50135","text":" machine. argument-hint: <question or decision to deliberate on> ---"}]},{"id":"blk-43482","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50136","text":"Topology and Deliberation"}]},{"id":"blk-43483","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50137","text":"Detect and reason through circular dependencies (cycles) in knowledge."}]},{"id":"blk-43484","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50138","text":"Key Concepts"}]},{"id":"blk-43485","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50139","marks":["bold"],"text":"kappa"},{"id":"spn-50140","text":" is the cycle-complexity invariant — it measures how entangled the knowledge is:"}]},{"id":"blk-43486","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43488","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50141","marks":["bold"],"text":"kappa = 0"},{"id":"spn-50142","text":" — acyclic DAG, no cycles. Safe for fast retrieval."}]}],"id":"blk-43487","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43490","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50143","marks":["bold"],"text":"kappa = 1"},{"id":"spn-50144","text":" — simple cycle (A->B->C->A). Deliberation may help for high-stakes decisions."}]}],"id":"blk-43489","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43492","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50145","marks":["bold"],"text":"kappa = 2+"},{"id":"spn-50146","text":" — nested/overlapping cycles. Deliberation strongly recommended."}]}],"id":"blk-43491","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-43493","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50147","marks":["bold"],"text":"SCCs (Strongly Connected Components)"},{"id":"spn-50148","text":" are maximal cyclic clusters — groups of nodes where every node can reach every other node through directed edges."}]},{"id":"blk-43494","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50149","marks":["bold"],"text":"Fault-line edges"},{"id":"spn-50150","text":" are the weakest links in a cycle — the assumptions most likely to be wrong. Examining these first is the fastest path to resolving contradictions."}]},{"id":"blk-43495","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50151","text":"Arguments"}]},{"id":"blk-43496","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50152","text":"Question to deliberate: $ARGUMENTS"}]},{"id":"blk-43497","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50153","text":"Analyze Topology"}]},{"id":"blk-43498","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50154","text":"Read-only diagnostic — understand the structure:"}]},{"id":"blk-43499","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"route(action: \"topology\", query: \"<topic>\")"},{"id":"blk-43500","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50155","marks":["bold"],"text":"Parameters:"}]},{"id":"blk-43501","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43503","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50156","marks":["code"],"text":"node_ids"},{"id":"spn-50157","text":" (optional) — explicit array of node IDs to analyze"}]}],"id":"blk-43502","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43505","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50158","marks":["code"],"text":"query"},{"id":"spn-50159","text":" (optional) — retrieve nodes by query, then analyze"}]}],"id":"blk-43504","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43507","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50160","text":"Neither — analyzes full graph"}]}],"id":"blk-43506","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-43508","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50161","text":"If both "},{"id":"spn-50162","marks":["code"],"text":"node_ids"},{"id":"spn-50163","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-50164","marks":["code"],"text":"query"},{"id":"spn-50165","text":" are provided, "},{"id":"spn-50166","marks":["code"],"text":"node_ids"},{"id":"spn-50167","text":" takes precedence."}]},{"id":"blk-43509","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50168","marks":["bold"],"text":"Response fields:"}]},{"id":"blk-43510","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43512","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50169","marks":["code"],"text":"routing"},{"id":"spn-50170","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-50171","marks":["code"],"text":"\"fast\""},{"id":"spn-50172","text":" or "},{"id":"spn-50173","marks":["code"],"text":"\"deliberate\""}]}],"id":"blk-43511","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43514","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50174","marks":["code"],"text":"max_kappa"},{"id":"spn-50175","text":" — highest kappa value found"}]}],"id":"blk-43513","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43516","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50176","marks":["code"],"text":"sccs"},{"id":"spn-50177","text":" — array of strongly connected components, each with its own "},{"id":"spn-50178","marks":["code"],"text":"routing"},{"id":"spn-50179","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-50180","marks":["code"],"text":"kappa"}]}],"id":"blk-43515","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43518","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50181","marks":["code"],"text":"fault_line_edges"},{"id":"spn-50182","text":" — weakest edges in cycles (examine these first)"}]}],"id":"blk-43517","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43520","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50183","marks":["code"],"text":"deliberation_budget"},{"id":"spn-50184","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-50185","marks":["code"],"text":"max_iterations"},{"id":"spn-50186","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-50187","marks":["code"],"text":"focus_edges"},{"id":"spn-50188","text":" to guide deliberation effort"}]}],"id":"blk-43519","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43522","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50189","marks":["code"],"text":"recommendation"},{"id":"spn-50190","text":" — human-readable guidance"}]}],"id":"blk-43521","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43524","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50191","marks":["code"],"text":"selection"},{"id":"spn-50192","text":" — how nodes were resolved (explicit/query/full_graph)"}]}],"id":"blk-43523","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43526","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50193","marks":["code"],"text":"approximate"},{"id":"spn-50194","text":" — whether analysis used approximation for large graphs"}]}],"id":"blk-43525","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-43527","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50195","text":"Deliberate Through Cycles"}]},{"id":"blk-43528","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50196","text":"Reason through cyclic knowledge and optionally persist conclusions:"}]},{"id":"blk-43529","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"route(action: \"deliberate\",\n  query: \"Should we use approach A or B given the conflicting evidence?\",\n  node_ids: [\"<node1>\", \"<node2>\"],\n  write_back: true\n)"},{"id":"blk-43530","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50197","marks":["bold"],"text":"Response fields:"}]},{"id":"blk-43531","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43533","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50198","marks":["code"],"text":"conclusions"},{"id":"spn-50199","text":" — array of resolved conclusions, each with "},{"id":"spn-50200","marks":["code"],"text":"source_scc_id"},{"id":"spn-50201","text":", "},{"id":"spn-50202","marks":["code"],"text":"source_kappa"},{"id":"spn-50203","text":", "},{"id":"spn-50204","marks":["code"],"text":"fault_lines_examined"}]}],"id":"blk-43532","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43535","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50205","marks":["code"],"text":"deliberation.converged"},{"id":"spn-50206","text":" — whether deliberation reached stable conclusions"}]}],"id":"blk-43534","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43537","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50207","marks":["code"],"text":"deliberation.iterations_used"},{"id":"spn-50208","text":" — how many reasoning passes were needed"}]}],"id":"blk-43536","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43539","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50209","marks":["code"],"text":"deliberation.topology_change"},{"id":"spn-50210","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-50211","marks":["code"],"text":"kappa_before"},{"id":"spn-50212","text":", "},{"id":"spn-50213","marks":["code"],"text":"kappa_after"},{"id":"spn-50214","text":", "},{"id":"spn-50215","marks":["code"],"text":"new_nodes_created"}]}],"id":"blk-43538","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-43540","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50216","text":"When to use "},{"id":"spn-50217","marks":["code"],"text":"write_back"}]},{"id":"blk-43541","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43543","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50218","marks":["code"],"text":"write_back: true"},{"id":"spn-50219","text":" — crystallizes conclusions as new nodes. Use when you've reached a resolution you want to persist (reduces kappa for future retrievals)."}]}],"id":"blk-43542","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43545","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50220","marks":["code"],"text":"write_back: false"},{"id":"spn-50221","text":" — reasoning only, no graph changes. Use for exploration or when you're not confident in the conclusion yet."}]}],"id":"blk-43544","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-43546","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50222","text":"Full Workflow"}]},{"id":"blk-43547","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50223","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-50224","marks":["bold"],"text":"Detect"},{"id":"spn-50225","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-50226","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve(action: \"context\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-50227","text":" returns "},{"id":"spn-50228","marks":["code"],"text":"topology.routing: \"deliberate\""},{"id":"spn-50229","text":" 2. "},{"id":"spn-50230","marks":["bold"],"text":"Diagnose"},{"id":"spn-50231","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-50232","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"topology\", query: \"...\")"},{"id":"spn-50233","text":" for detailed cycle info and fault-lines 3. "},{"id":"spn-50234","marks":["bold"],"text":"Examine fault-lines"},{"id":"spn-50235","text":" — inspect the weakest edges identified in step 2 4. "},{"id":"spn-50236","marks":["bold"],"text":"Deliberate"},{"id":"spn-50237","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-50238","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"deliberate\", query: \"...\", write_back: true)"},{"id":"spn-50239","text":" to reason through and resolve 5. "},{"id":"spn-50240","marks":["bold"],"text":"Verify"},{"id":"spn-50241","text":" — re-run "},{"id":"spn-50242","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"topology\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-50243","text":" to confirm kappa decreased after resolution"}]},{"id":"blk-43548","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-50244","text":"When NOT to deliberate"}]},{"id":"blk-43549","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43551","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50245","text":"When "},{"id":"spn-50246","marks":["code"],"text":"routing: \"fast\""},{"id":"spn-50247","text":" — normal retrieval is sufficient"}]}],"id":"blk-43550","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43553","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50248","text":"For low-stakes decisions — deliberation has a cost"}]}],"id":"blk-43552","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43555","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50249","text":"When there are no cycles (kappa = 0) — nothing to deliberate about"}]}],"id":"blk-43554","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43557","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-50250","text":"Over-deliberation is an anti-pattern — only deliberate when routing recommends it or you suspect contradictions"}]}],"id":"blk-43556","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaieraxuss6n2hqg3up2qmc7qy6kyqr74jp2cwkvdwrywcrvcudgaeozla","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}